{
  "id": "dcWhatsAppBot001",
  "name": "DocChat: WhatsApp bot",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## DocChat WhatsApp bot\nWhatsApp Business Cloud API (Meta). A chat is linked by sending `link <code>` (code from DocChat > Workspace > Chat apps), then questions go to that workspace with a **service key** and `X-DocChat-Link`.\n\n- `new`, `unlink`, `help`.\n- Files sent to the number are added; the second trigger says when they are ready.\n- Only replies to people who wrote first, inside WhatsApp's 24-hour window. No template messages.\n- Voice messages are transcribed (Groq Whisper) and answered; with `DOCCHAT_VOICE_REPLIES=true` the answer also comes back as audio.\n\nSetup: see `n8n/README.md`.",
        "width": 500,
        "height": 380
      },
      "id": "7f50c867-0783-5b76-bc30-2c024937328a",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -500,
        -320
      ]
    },
